stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AppBoot
    AppBoot --> AuthStateResolving: CascadingAuthenticationState
    AuthStateResolving --> Login: anonymous route /login
    AuthStateResolving --> AuthorizedShell: authenticated
    AuthStateResolving --> RedirectGate: protected route anonymous
    RedirectGate --> Login: RedirectToLogin preserves local returnUrl
    Login --> MicrosoftChallenge: click Microsoft
    Login --> GuestCookie: click Guest in Dev or Test
    MicrosoftChallenge --> AuthorizedShell: OIDC callback creates cookie
    GuestCookie --> AuthorizedShell: fake login creates cookie
    AuthorizedShell --> ObserverHub: /
    AuthorizedShell --> LiveDashboard: /live
    AuthorizedShell --> IdentityNexus: /identity
    AuthorizedShell --> Archives: /archives
    AuthorizedShell --> Diagnostics: /diagnostics
    AuthorizedShell --> NotFound: unmatched client route
    AuthorizedShell --> Login: logout clears cookie
    state AuthorizedShell {
        [*] --> MainLayout
        MainLayout --> AuthorizeRouteView
        AuthorizeRouteView --> FlashMitigation: Authorizing text only
        FlashMitigation --> PageContent
    }
